    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nSherry FitzGerald Conor McManus are pleased to present No. 10 Fairview Crescent, Killygoan, Monaghan Town to the market.\n\nA solid three-bedroom, semi-detached house, with plenty of scope for the purchaser to modernise and personalise the interior to their own taste. \n\nA particular feature is the generous rear garden, which is laid predominantly in lawn and bordered by mature evergreen planting, providing excellent outdoor space and a good degree of privacy.\n\nThe accommodation comprises, at ground floor level, an entrance porch and hall, sitting room, living/dining room and kitchen. Upstairs there are three bedrooms, a bathroom and landing.\n\nSituated in the established residential area of Killygoan, the property enjoys the convenience of a Monaghan town location, with schools, shops, leisure facilities and the many amenities of the town within easy reach. \n\nViewing highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nSitting Room: - \nBright and spacious sitting room featuring timber-effect flooring and an attractive marble-effect fireplace with open fire. .\n\nLiving/ Dining Room: - \nBright and spacious open-plan living and dining area with wood-effect flooring and a large window overlooking the rear garden, allowing for plenty of natural light.\n\nKitchen: - \nFitted with wall and floor units, worktop space and tiled splashback. Includes stainless steel sink, freestanding cooker, washing machine and fridge, with tiled flooring and access to the rear.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nBright and spacious double bedroom with carpet flooring and a large window providing plenty of natural light and pleasant views.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nBright bedroom, carpet flooring and a large window providing plenty of natural light.\n\nBedroom 3: - \nWell-proportioned bedroom with carpet flooring, built-in storage and good natural light.\n\nBathroom: - \nFeaturing a bath with shower screen, pedestal wash hand basin and W.C., with wall panelling.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Total floor area: 82 sq mts ( 883 sq ft) approx.</li><li>Convenient Monaghan Town location</li><li>Mature and established residential area</li><li>Excellent condition throughout</li><li>Enclosed rear garden</li><li>Within easy reach of local schools, shops and everyday amenities</li><li>uPVC double-glazed windows</li><li>Oil fired central heating</li><li>High-speed broadband available</li><li>Great investment opportunity or family home</ul>"
      },
